description: API security, time, and persistence rules
globs: apps/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API

- Validate auth and role on the server for every protected route.
- Daily-work window and lock use server time + company timezone, never `Date` from the client.
- After `submitted_at` is set, reject content updates at the service/model layer.
- Persist chat messages in Supabase Postgres before emitting Socket.IO events. Do not persist typing indicators.
- Avatars go through Supabase Storage via the API service role. Never ship `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` to the web app.
- Return `{ error: { code, message } }` via `AppError`. Do not leak stack traces.
